        "description": "The Odyssey Trunk is your ultimate skincare companion, thoughtfully curated to deliver top-to-toe care with maximum benefits. \n<br><br>\n<b>New year, fresh look, same beloved products!</b><br>\nAs we step into 2025, we’re leveling up & taking you along on the journey. With the Odyssey Trunk, be among the first to experience our refreshed look! \n<br><br>\n<b>Everything You Need, Anywhere You Go</b><br>\nCrafted to suit all skin moods, you can cleanse with the Melting Balm Cleanser, hydrate and brighten with the Eye Serum, nourish your face with the Radiance Face Oil, and the body with the Vitamin C Body Oil.\n<br><br>\n<b>Ready. Set. Glow.</b><br>\nWith the Aminu Passport to help you understand your products & double as a travel checklist, and the Glow-Trotter luggage tag, you will be prepared, no matter where life takes you.",
